{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fa732994ded98eb8","name":"Dark Lizard","source":{"id":"source:reference-fa732994ded98eb8","title":"Dark Lizard","revision":21541,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:59:51Z","sha256":"b58447e49d8a686f669f66dbf463917f068c37140a4d22e71ad08ca047dd3666","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21541","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Dark%20Lizard&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fa732994ded98eb8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Echoes of the Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Echoes_of_the_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:e6a2e80208e1e351"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Believers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Believers","referenceId":"reference:e44a419b610a5e71"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The Dark Lizards' hungry, inky tongues unfurl from gullets that seem bottomless, thanks to the 10-centimeter ebon teeth lining their mouths, which dribble tarlike drool. These beasts resemble living shadows, and only their ivory claws indicate that their origin is not supernatural. Their obsidian hides radiate incalculably vile energy. There is no sign of intelligence in their primeval gazes, only the brand of distilled evil- their eyes smolder with the orange-red glow of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},"."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Dark Lizard is a species of reptilian ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hssiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hssiss","referenceId":"reference:5a134ca522919ec1"}," drenched in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," to such to a degree that its eye